WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:29.310 --> 01:33.830
HoneyHoney Candy, Mobile
Manucure, Invisibility Crystals...

01:33.830 --> 01:35.480
and whatever this is.

01:36.860 --> 01:40.360
Dance Bonbons that will make
the eater want to dance!

01:42.400 --> 01:44.780
You never know when
it'll come in handy,

01:44.780 --> 01:46.330
so I may as well just
take everything.

01:48.530 --> 01:49.740
So you're really going...

01:50.490 --> 01:52.370
to see that witch named Amber?

01:53.120 --> 01:55.370
Yep. If I ask her,

01:55.370 --> 01:58.210
I might learn a way to save Vanilla,

01:58.210 --> 01:59.800
and about Mama.

02:00.250 --> 02:02.760
In that case, we're going too.

02:02.760 --> 02:04.270
Oh no you aren't.

02:04.760 --> 02:06.680
I could be disqualified
as a Queen Candidate...

02:06.680 --> 02:10.310
for leaving the Human World
without permission.

02:10.310 --> 02:13.720
If we get caught, you'll be
in trouble as my Knights.

02:15.520 --> 02:18.980
We're always on your
side, Chocolat.

02:18.980 --> 02:19.900
But...

02:20.360 --> 02:22.780
You're all forgetting the
most important thing.

02:23.400 --> 02:26.030
Ever since the Night of Walpurgis,
the path between the worlds...

02:26.030 --> 02:28.000
has been closed by Queen
Candy's decree.

02:28.490 --> 02:31.990
Oh yeah, I totally forgot about that!

02:32.450 --> 02:36.500
Just when I thought I had a
chance to help Vanilla...

02:38.960 --> 02:43.460
Well, there's nothing
my magic can't do.

02:44.800 --> 02:45.760
For real?

02:45.760 --> 02:47.090
How rude!

02:47.090 --> 02:50.260
You do have the map of the Cocoa
Desert where Amber is, right?

02:50.970 --> 02:52.140
Yeah, right here.

02:53.350 --> 02:54.470
Ribbit!!

02:54.470 --> 02:56.130
Ribbit!! Ribbit!!

02:56.520 --> 02:58.640
Ribbit!! Ribbit!!

03:02.150 --> 03:04.940
Could this be an entrance
to the Magical World?

03:04.940 --> 03:05.900
It sure is!

03:06.450 --> 03:07.990
That's the ticket!

03:08.700 --> 03:11.240
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

03:15.540 --> 03:17.410
Alrighty! Dive!

03:21.250 --> 03:22.380
Houx-sama!

03:23.960 --> 03:26.590
Houx-sama, wait for me!

03:35.310 --> 03:37.850
Witch of the Cocoa Desert: Amber

03:39.520 --> 03:41.560
Chocolat's gone to Amber's place?

03:42.150 --> 03:44.060
Yes, Queen Candy.

03:45.230 --> 03:47.280
It's against the rules for
Queen Candidates...

03:47.280 --> 03:50.910
to leave the Human World
without permission.

03:51.320 --> 03:54.580
We should see what Chocolat will do
to resolve the standoff with the Ogres...

03:54.580 --> 03:56.920
and her issues with Vanilla.

03:57.790 --> 04:00.500
I believe this is a good chance to see...

04:00.500 --> 04:03.500
if she has what it takes to be Queen.

04:04.090 --> 04:06.050
Somewhere in my heart,

04:06.050 --> 04:07.880
I am also pinning my hopes on Chocolat.

04:09.050 --> 04:10.770
As the Queen,

04:10.770 --> 04:13.510
and as Vanilla's mother.

04:14.680 --> 04:18.350
I just wish those feelings
would reach Vanilla.

04:27.820 --> 04:30.070
Vanilla, is your heart in pain?

04:31.530 --> 04:32.650
Pardon me.

04:33.360 --> 04:34.240
What is it?

04:34.240 --> 04:37.830
Chocolat has gone to the Magical
World to see a witch called Amber.

04:39.580 --> 04:40.960
Despite her inexperience,

04:40.960 --> 04:43.830
she seeks to remove
Vanilla-sama's Noir heart.

04:45.920 --> 04:48.090
In the event that
Chocolat does not return,

04:48.760 --> 04:52.070
Vanilla-sama's becoming
Queen is assured.

04:53.430 --> 04:55.840
Chocolat-chan's doing all this for me?

04:58.930 --> 05:00.730
If you can overcome this pain,

05:00.730 --> 05:02.770
you can become the next Queen.

05:03.230 --> 05:04.190
The next...

05:13.820 --> 05:16.620
Why am I on the bottom?
I'm the lightest!

05:18.790 --> 05:20.870
So this is the Cocoa Desert?

05:20.870 --> 05:22.880
Duke, where's that map?

05:23.580 --> 05:26.580
I had to use it to form
the entrance to the Magical World.

05:27.880 --> 05:32.520
How are we going to find her in this
huuuuge desert without a map?

05:43.770 --> 05:44.600
Cirus?

05:50.690 --> 05:54.120
These unmannered people are
trespassing in my desert.

05:54.530 --> 05:56.540
I must expel them without delay.

06:02.450 --> 06:04.000
Huh? Rain?

06:06.950 --> 06:08.050
It's sweet!

06:08.380 --> 06:12.560
Of course! We're in the Cocoa
Desert, so this is chocolate rain!

06:13.050 --> 06:14.630
I bet it tastes great.

06:16.720 --> 06:18.010
Ow-ow-ow...

06:18.550 --> 06:19.430
Take cover!

06:18.550 --> 06:19.430
What's this?

06:20.010 --> 06:21.860
Take cover? Where?

06:21.860 --> 06:23.930
This really hurts!

06:23.930 --> 06:26.520
Houx-sama, I've come to save you!

06:27.480 --> 06:28.370
Waffle!

06:28.810 --> 06:30.860
Bii, be our umbrella!

06:36.070 --> 06:38.880
Aaah! I'm soo close to Houx-saxna!

06:39.160 --> 06:40.830
Why are you here?

06:40.830 --> 06:43.370
You did a bad thing in coming here.

06:43.370 --> 06:44.000
Huh?

06:44.000 --> 06:45.370
You're going too far, Saule.

06:46.290 --> 06:49.750
But, Waffle, we came
here to save Vanilla.

06:49.750 --> 06:50.890
Not to play.

06:51.290 --> 06:54.210
But I want to be useful too!

06:55.210 --> 06:57.720
I'm sorry about what happened
on the night of the party.

06:57.720 --> 07:00.900
I won't cause trouble like that again.

07:02.010 --> 07:02.890
Please!

07:04.560 --> 07:05.520
Okay.

07:06.430 --> 07:07.770
Really?

07:07.770 --> 07:09.400
You sure about this, Chocolat?

07:09.400 --> 07:11.910
Not like we can send her home now.

07:12.320 --> 07:13.860
Thank you, Chocolat!

07:21.030 --> 07:22.410
Bii...

07:23.030 --> 07:24.370
Stay strong!

07:25.830 --> 07:27.160
It's a storm.

07:27.160 --> 07:29.420
The cocoa sand is getting in my eyes.

07:29.830 --> 07:32.090
Maybe we should go back!

07:32.090 --> 07:34.130
What're you saying, Duke!?

07:34.130 --> 07:36.380
No, Duke may be right.

07:42.760 --> 07:43.760
It's a twister!

07:44.220 --> 07:45.060
Run for it!

07:46.180 --> 07:47.850
If we're sucked in, it's game over!

07:48.350 --> 07:49.810
Wait, Houx-sama!

07:51.310 --> 07:52.150
Waffle!

07:52.900 --> 07:54.320
Houx, Waffle!

07:54.320 --> 07:55.480
It's hopeless!

07:55.480 --> 07:56.360
You'll never make it!

07:58.530 --> 07:59.400
Chocolat!

08:03.370 --> 08:04.430
Chocolat...

08:04.830 --> 08:07.160
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

08:07.160 --> 08:08.660
Fleur Spirale!

08:24.350 --> 08:25.550
Don't give up!

08:35.650 --> 08:37.620
I wondered how we'd
get out of that one.

08:41.280 --> 08:43.160
Well done, Chocolat.

08:44.280 --> 08:46.740
If I let something like
a twister stop me,

08:46.740 --> 08:48.160
I'd never be able to save Vanilla.

08:48.910 --> 08:50.200
C'mon, let's go.

08:50.200 --> 08:50.910
Yeah!

08:51.460 --> 08:52.180
Hmm...

08:52.620 --> 08:54.920
So that's her magic at its best.

08:54.920 --> 08:56.710
Not a shred of potential in her.

09:00.840 --> 09:01.930
It's too hard!

09:02.260 --> 09:05.180
I'm so thirsty I can't
walk another step.

09:05.180 --> 09:06.850
Keep going a little bit longer.

09:06.850 --> 09:08.680
How much longer?

09:08.680 --> 09:12.330
No matter where we go,
all we see is cocoa sand.

09:14.980 --> 09:16.900
Or maybe not!

09:23.070 --> 09:25.200
It's a mint fountain pond!

09:26.410 --> 09:27.700
Wait, Waffle!

09:29.790 --> 09:30.700
Yaay!

09:34.920 --> 09:36.710
There's juice trees, too!

09:36.710 --> 09:39.210
I found some, too! They're amazing!

09:39.880 --> 09:43.130
I have to question the presence
of a pond way out here.

09:43.590 --> 09:48.010
The cool mint flavor is
melting in my mouth.

09:49.180 --> 09:50.890
And... they're not listening.

09:51.520 --> 09:54.140
It tastes like cranberry juice.

09:54.140 --> 09:56.230
This one is Blood Orange.

09:56.230 --> 09:58.400
It's packed full of delicious
lemon flavor!

10:01.110 --> 10:02.400
What the heck? Cocoa?

10:03.360 --> 10:04.320
Too sweet...

10:04.320 --> 10:06.070
This one's cocoa too...

10:06.070 --> 10:07.990
What? Why??

10:07.990 --> 10:10.410
I'm even thirstier than before.

10:10.910 --> 10:14.290
If we dig through the sand, the mint
fountain might spring up again!

10:15.540 --> 10:17.380
Waffle, stop it!

10:17.380 --> 10:18.380
I want...

10:19.540 --> 10:23.680
I want you to praise me,
just like you praise Chocolat!

10:25.840 --> 10:26.760
What?

10:27.220 --> 10:28.090
Waffle!

10:28.090 --> 10:30.010
Houx-sama, help me!

10:30.010 --> 10:31.310
Waffle, take my hand!

10:33.390 --> 10:35.820
Houx-sama's hand is so warm...

10:36.140 --> 10:38.520
This is no time for fangirling!

10:39.610 --> 10:40.440
Houx!

10:41.860 --> 10:42.620
Chocolat!

10:45.570 --> 10:47.990
It's going to pull us all under!

10:52.910 --> 10:54.540
Ruban de Lierre!

11:08.800 --> 11:10.890
I've got cocoa sand all over me!

11:10.890 --> 11:12.970
I wanna take a shower!

11:12.970 --> 11:14.440
Let's go home, Houx-sama.

11:15.470 --> 11:17.520
For once, I agree with Waffle.

11:18.730 --> 11:21.730
We won't be able to save Vanilla
by sticking around here,

11:21.730 --> 11:23.230
and we'll just endanger ourselves.

11:24.400 --> 11:26.490
I know how you feel, Chocolat,

11:26.490 --> 11:29.200
but I think we should give up
on meeting Amber for now.

11:29.200 --> 11:30.780
and rethink our plans.

11:31.740 --> 11:32.740
Houx...

11:36.000 --> 11:37.210
Okay.

11:37.660 --> 11:40.330
They're more spineless
than I thought.

11:40.330 --> 11:41.330
I'm staying here.

11:43.090 --> 11:45.670
You guys can go home,
but I'm staying.

11:46.170 --> 11:47.170
Chocolat...

11:47.670 --> 11:50.510
Vanilla's been suffering for so long...

11:51.010 --> 11:53.230
that I can't just give up now.

11:54.470 --> 11:56.430
Vanilla's that important to you?

11:56.970 --> 11:59.060
Yeah, she is.

11:59.060 --> 12:01.480
Even though we're separated now,

12:01.480 --> 12:04.110
I believe we can go back
to the way we were.

12:04.110 --> 12:07.860
That's why I just have
to meet Amber,

12:10.660 --> 12:11.860
All right, Chocolat.

12:12.530 --> 12:14.080
We'll come with you.

12:15.490 --> 12:18.330
If Houx-sama's going,
then I'm going too!

12:18.790 --> 12:19.750
You guys...

12:20.460 --> 12:24.340
All right, let's put a smile on our
faces and go look for Amber!

12:24.340 --> 12:25.590
Yeah!

12:25.590 --> 12:26.850
Yeah...

12:27.300 --> 12:30.100
It looks like our objective...
found us.

12:35.010 --> 12:36.850
Amber's house?

12:49.400 --> 12:50.860
Anybody home?

12:52.530 --> 12:54.320
Not one for manners, are you?

12:55.450 --> 12:57.240
When entering someone's house,

12:57.240 --> 12:59.920
you must do so with their approval.

13:00.290 --> 13:03.470
I hate being bothered by
visitors most of all.

13:04.710 --> 13:06.920
You're the Great Witch Amber?

13:07.420 --> 13:10.340
When speaking to your elders,
you must do so politely.

13:10.340 --> 13:12.720
Also, when asking someone's name,

13:12.720 --> 13:14.470
you must first give yours.

13:14.470 --> 13:17.430
Did I not tell you that I despise
the unmannered?

13:18.390 --> 13:20.770
Chocolat. Chocolat Meilleure.

13:21.680 --> 13:24.810
A witch does not reveal her
own name so easily.

13:25.520 --> 13:26.980
Saw that one coming.

13:26.980 --> 13:28.820
Oh yes, I remember!

13:28.820 --> 13:31.870
Amber is the most eccentric weirdo
in the Magical World...

13:31.870 --> 13:33.320
not to mention ancient!

13:35.070 --> 13:37.160
Cirus, get him.

13:38.950 --> 13:41.120
Don't blame me just because...

13:41.120 --> 13:42.960
you can't handle the truth!

13:42.960 --> 13:44.250
Duke!

13:44.250 --> 13:45.500
Chocolat Meilleure.

13:46.460 --> 13:46.930
Yes.

13:47.460 --> 13:49.140
So you're Cinnamon's daughter?

13:50.000 --> 13:51.130
Yes I am!

13:51.130 --> 13:53.140
So you really did know my mom?

13:54.630 --> 13:57.600
I don't care to reminisce
about old times.

13:57.600 --> 13:58.850
I'm too busy for that.

14:03.640 --> 14:05.890
If you have no business here,
then go on home.

14:06.730 --> 14:07.400
Vanilla is...

14:08.480 --> 14:10.730
By "Vanilla," I mean my best friend,

14:10.730 --> 14:13.690
who's also a candidate
to become Queen.

14:13.690 --> 14:17.280
The Ogres implanted a
Noir heart inside her.

14:18.490 --> 14:21.450
But Robin told me that
you might know a way...

14:21.450 --> 14:23.830
to remove Vanilla's Noir heart.

14:24.370 --> 14:25.330
Hmm?

14:28.040 --> 14:29.380
Robin said that?

14:34.260 --> 14:35.970
Please tell Chocolat.

14:37.090 --> 14:39.180
"I want to know!" "Tell me!"

14:39.180 --> 14:42.100
You're quite mistaken if you think those words will open every door for you.

14:43.470 --> 14:45.940
I don't know how great
a witch you are,

14:45.940 --> 14:48.440
but all you do is make
people feel bad!

14:48.440 --> 14:49.980
Waffle...

14:49.980 --> 14:54.070
How hard do you think we've
worked to get this far?

14:54.070 --> 14:57.160
Our bodies are worn out,
and our throats are bone-dry!

14:57.490 --> 15:01.130
Still, all you can say is "manners
this" and "manners that"!

15:01.580 --> 15:03.950
Is that any way to greet guests?

15:03.950 --> 15:06.170
No soft cushions?

15:06.500 --> 15:07.960
No cold lemonade?

15:09.630 --> 15:11.170
What was that for?!

15:11.170 --> 15:13.890
Waffle, have a Dance Bonbon.

15:14.800 --> 15:15.390
Huh?

15:15.920 --> 15:18.720
Why do I suddenly
feel like dancing?

15:23.810 --> 15:24.890
I'm begging you,

15:24.890 --> 15:28.140
please tell me how
I can save Vanilla.

15:31.650 --> 15:33.820
It will require powerful magic.

15:34.570 --> 15:35.910
It's too much for you.

15:36.690 --> 15:39.110
You might lose your life.

15:39.820 --> 15:40.750
Will you still proceed?

15:42.490 --> 15:43.250
Yes.

15:45.410 --> 15:46.200
I understand.

15:48.000 --> 15:50.260
Aah, I'm all danced out.

15:51.670 --> 15:52.760
This is it.

15:53.250 --> 15:55.300
To remove a black heart,

15:55.300 --> 15:57.460
a Mandragora flower is necessary.

15:57.460 --> 15:58.770
A Mandragora flower?

15:59.300 --> 16:01.840
It's a flower that grows
on Mt. Piman.

16:01.840 --> 16:05.060
However, plucking that flower
means courting danger.

16:05.060 --> 16:06.020
I don't care.

16:06.020 --> 16:08.430
Please tell me where Mt. Piman is.

16:13.520 --> 16:14.620
Pierre-sama...

16:15.270 --> 16:17.030
I've received word from our
subordinates in the Magical World...

16:17.030 --> 16:20.630
saying that Chocolat et al have
set off for Mt. Piman.

16:21.660 --> 16:22.620
To Mount Piman?

16:23.280 --> 16:26.280
It is probable that they
seek the Mandragora flower.

16:35.880 --> 16:37.640
It is too dangerous, Pierre-sama...

16:37.640 --> 16:41.470
to open a door to the Magical
World with your own powers!

16:41.470 --> 16:43.050
You're using too much magic...

16:43.050 --> 16:44.840
I can't let Chocolat do as she wishes.

16:52.650 --> 16:55.520
What kind of flowers would
bloom in a place like this?

16:57.570 --> 16:59.900
I smell some strange gas.

16:59.900 --> 17:02.820
And it's so hot I don't wanna
walk anymore.

17:02.820 --> 17:05.120
And thanks to the smoke,
we can't take to the skies.

17:05.120 --> 17:06.450
No choice but to walk.

17:06.450 --> 17:08.950
My feet hurt so bad I can't move.

17:08.950 --> 17:11.500
Just look at all these blisters!

17:12.460 --> 17:14.170
Knock it off, will you?

17:14.170 --> 17:17.290
Chocolat's more tired than any of us.

17:17.290 --> 17:19.510
Why is it always "Chocolat, Chocolat..."?

17:26.970 --> 17:28.810
A Mandragora flower?

17:29.520 --> 17:31.730
If you keep acting so selfish,

17:31.730 --> 17:33.520
we really will leave you behind.

17:33.520 --> 17:34.980
Who made you king?

17:34.980 --> 17:37.610
Houx-sama would never be so mean.

17:37.610 --> 17:39.110
Right, Houx-sama?

17:39.110 --> 17:42.080
Well, then why not ask "Houx-sama"
to carry you?

17:42.610 --> 17:44.910
Besides, you said you
wanted to be useful,

17:44.910 --> 17:48.030
but you're just causing trouble
and slowing us down.

17:48.580 --> 17:50.240
That's so mean!

17:50.240 --> 17:52.410
Hey! Chocolat's gone!

17:52.410 --> 17:53.580
What'd you say?

17:53.580 --> 17:54.330
Chocolat!

18:04.760 --> 18:06.510
Is this a Mandragora plant?

18:07.180 --> 18:09.970
If you carelessly attempt
to pluck a Mandragora,

18:09.970 --> 18:13.730
it will emit a scream more frightening
than anything in the world.

18:13.730 --> 18:17.820
It is said that those who hear that
scream will die, instantly.

18:17.820 --> 18:19.190
Be cautious.

18:20.730 --> 18:23.360
Softly... slowly...

18:23.360 --> 18:24.150
Chocolat.

18:26.450 --> 18:27.410
Pierre?

18:27.410 --> 18:28.910
Why are you here?

18:28.910 --> 18:32.330
I need Vanilla to become
the Ogre Queen.

18:32.330 --> 18:33.200
Don't get in our way.

18:33.750 --> 18:36.510
Is that what Vanilla really wants?

18:37.250 --> 18:39.170
It's what Vanilla decided.

18:39.170 --> 18:40.730
Step away from the plant, Chocolat.

18:41.420 --> 18:44.740
If you don't, you'll be vanishing
along with that Mandragora.

18:45.260 --> 18:46.980
Pierre, please stop this!

18:47.510 --> 18:49.020
Move aside, Chocolat.

18:49.680 --> 18:52.230
I know Vanilla has two hearts.

18:52.600 --> 18:54.230
There's no way Vanilla
wouldn't suffer...

18:54.560 --> 18:58.390
from having a black heart
next to her gentle heart.

18:59.100 --> 18:59.980
That's why...

19:01.690 --> 19:04.740
That's why I have to take Vanilla's
Noir out as soon as possible.

19:08.610 --> 19:12.260
And I need this Mandragora
flower to do that.

19:13.620 --> 19:16.040
There's no use trying to stop me.
I'll save Vanilla...

19:17.660 --> 19:18.250
Chocolat!

19:18.710 --> 19:19.370
Chocolat!

19:24.170 --> 19:25.130
Chocolat!

19:25.130 --> 19:26.140
It's Pierre!

19:32.350 --> 19:33.890
My magic's running out...

19:37.230 --> 19:38.230
Chocolat!

19:38.230 --> 19:39.240
Are you all right?

19:39.600 --> 19:41.520
What've you done to Chocolat?

19:42.230 --> 19:43.400
Feuille Epee!

19:44.360 --> 19:45.440
Stop it, Houx!

19:47.820 --> 19:48.950
Did he get away?

19:48.950 --> 19:51.860
Wait, Pierre saved me.

19:54.680 --> 19:57.870
Could it be that Pierre has
two hearts inside of him,

19:57.870 --> 20:00.750
just like Vanilla does?

20:01.880 --> 20:05.840
It was Pierre's other heart
the one that isn't Noir,

20:05.840 --> 20:07.590
that led him to save me.

20:08.050 --> 20:08.970
Is that how it is?

20:11.680 --> 20:15.640
Watch me! I'll get a Mandragora
before Chocolat!

20:17.680 --> 20:18.980
Quit it, Waffle!

20:18.980 --> 20:21.820
If you hear its scream,
it's all over for you!

20:22.310 --> 20:24.700
I'll be fine! I'll just pull it out first.

20:25.110 --> 20:27.280
Bii, pull harder!

20:27.940 --> 20:28.840
Waffle!

20:31.700 --> 20:33.280
The Mandragora's about to scream!

20:33.820 --> 20:35.620
Cover your ears, everybody!

20:39.120 --> 20:41.170
It's too late, noo...

20:41.540 --> 20:45.920
Oh yeah! I just have to get
it out of the ground.

20:47.920 --> 20:50.180
Mandragora, dance!

21:01.810 --> 21:03.400
A Dance Bonbon?

21:03.400 --> 21:05.400
The Mandragora's starting to dance.

21:15.370 --> 21:16.420
This is for me?

21:18.080 --> 21:19.170
Thank you!

21:21.000 --> 21:22.540
Um, Chocolat...

21:23.670 --> 21:26.380
I'm sorry. Thanks for saving me.

21:27.380 --> 21:29.800
Waffle, I'm so glad you're okay!

21:29.800 --> 21:30.390
Yeah.

21:32.630 --> 21:34.720
What am I doing?

21:36.640 --> 21:38.390
When I look at Chocolat,

21:38.390 --> 21:40.600
I can't leave her alone.

21:41.640 --> 21:44.020
Even though my heart should
be frozen solid.

21:46.150 --> 21:47.910
What's that familiar scent?

21:48.690 --> 21:49.610
Ginger Village?

21:54.360 --> 21:55.570
A forest of ice...

22:03.870 --> 22:08.830
Cinnamon, your daughter's got guts,
I'll give her that much.

22:10.050 --> 22:13.180
I'm sure I can save Vanilla with this!

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:47.770 --> 23:50.440
I got ahold of a Mandragora flower.

23:50.440 --> 23:53.410
This will let me pick up Vanilla's Noir heart!

23:54.540 --> 23:55.660
What? My magic's not good enough?

23:55.660 --> 23:58.090
What? My magic's not good enough?

23:58.090 --> 23:59.560
It can't be true...

24:00.350 --> 24:02.270
What can I do??

24:02.270 --> 24:04.360
Please help me, Amber!

24:05.240 --> 24:07.770
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.770 --> 24:10.330
Frozen Memories, Pierre's Past.

24:11.000 --> 24:13.050
If you don't watch it,
I'll whup your butt!

24:13.050 --> 24:14.050
Thanks!
